re blends \n•	Cocktail / fruity notes are trending but paired with depth (woods, musk) \n•	Experimental, provocative scent storytelling is rising \nOlfactive Direction:\nCocktail × Sweet × Boozy × Textural\nSignature Structure:\n•	Top Notes (First Sip): \no	Rum / Cognac Accord \no	Cherry / Dark Berry \no	Citrus Zest (orange peel / yuzu) \n•	Heart Notes (Buzz): \no	Espresso Shot / Coffee Foam \no	Caramelized Sugar \no	Spiced Cinnamon / Nutmeg \n•	Base Notes (Aftertaste): \no	Tonka Bean \no	Vanilla Smoke \no	Oak Barrel / Whisky Wood \nVariations:\n•	Espresso Martini → coffee + vodka + vanilla \n•	Cherry Highball → cherry + sparkling citrus + musk \n•	Burnt Sugar Night → caramel + rum + smoky wood \nPositioning Language:\n“Not a drink. A feeling. Sweet, dark, addictive — the scent of losing control.”\n\nSERIES 03: AWARENESS\nConcept: Presence, lightness, clarity, awakening\nTrend alignment accord:\n•	“Skin scents” and subtle fragrances are trending \n•	Fresh scents are becoming more airy, mineral, and modern \n•	Consumers want lighter, everyday wearable scents \nOlfactive Direction:\nFresh × Bright × Clean × Minimal\nSignature Structure:\n•	Top Notes (Awakening): \no	Bergamot \no	Lemon Leaf \no	Green Apple \n•	Heart Notes (Clarity): \no	White Tea \no	Neroli \no	Water Lily / Aquatic Accord \n•	Base Notes (Soft Presence): \no	Clean Musk \no	Light Cedarwood \no	Mineral / Skin Accord \nVariations:\n•	Morning Air → citrus + tea + light musk \n•	Skin Light → minimal musk + soft wood \n•	Ocean Mind → aquatic + mineral + citrus \n\nPositioning Language:\n“Barely there. But everything changes. A scent that feels like being awake.”\n\nFINAL BRAND FEEL (reference)\nThis collection will feel like:\n•	Flow State → Aesop × Zen \n•	Drunk → Byredo × Nightlife \n•	Awareness → Le Labo × Clean Air', '泰国咖啡店创香-DRUNK', '1', '无', NULL, NULL, NULL);
